<https://w3id.org/dseco/ontology/SERVICEID> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "A SERVICEID is an identifier of a service, it is associated to a FQDN and can be used to link security indicators."@en .
<https://w3id.org/dseco/ontology/SERVICEID> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Un SERVICEID est un identifiant de service associé à un FQDN et pouvant servir à relier des indicateurs de sécurité."@fr .
